# SettleIQ — Line Ending Normalization
# Enforce canonical LF line endings across all platforms to guarantee bit-identical SHA-256 hashes

* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
proof/builds/LATEST/* text eol=lf

# Binary media formats must never undergo line ending conversion
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
